*** Settings ***
Documentation
    ...  This test case is created to trigger SoC recovery.
    ...  Test will randomly select SoC from ABIN or ABIO.
    ...  Fault will be generated by crashing DSP resulting in L1Soc NR DL DSP group.
    ...  Also recovery action will be checked and counter is incremented correctly.

Resource  ../../common_resources/ca_FM_general.robot


*** Variables ***
${STARTUP_TIMEOUT}  600  # Timeout for SBTS to recover after site reset
${FAULT_NUMBER}  9101  # Fault that must be set in faultSnapshotTriggers
${TRIGGER_TYPE}  onFaultDetection  # Trigger type that must be set in faultSnapshotTriggers
${HW_VARIANT}  Loki  # SOC's hardware variant
${RAT_TYPE}  NR  # SOC's cells type
${BBMOD_TYPE}  ABIO  # BBMOD type can be ABIO, ABIN, aSOE
${CRASH_COMMAND}  devmem 0x87E044181600 64 1  # Command to trigger the crash


*** Keywords ***
